            "question": "What perfume size is allowed on a plane?",
            "answer": "For cabin baggage, individual liquid containers must be 100ml or smaller, carried in a clear resealable bag alongside your other liquids. Travel size perfumes and minis of 10ml to 50ml are ideal, and there is no size limit for perfume in checked luggage."
