            "question": "How much perfume can you fly with?",
            "answer": "In hand luggage, each container must be 100ml or less and fit in your clear liquids bag. In checked luggage there is no practical size limit, though airlines cap the total quantity of aerosols and flammable liquids, so check your airline if carrying several large bottles."
